<title>USA: Whitewater prosecutor says he'll stay on job.</title>
<headline>Whitewater prosecutor says he'll stay on job.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Whitewater prosecutor Kenneth Starr annnounced on Friday he will remain in charge of the inquiry involving President and Mrs. Clinton &quot;until the investigation and any resulting prosecutions ... have been substantially completed.&quot;</p>
</text>
